  by: agent  # b4ff
  actor: jgstern_agent  # b4ff
  clock: 4  # b4ff
  nonce: b4ff  # b4ff
  message: "MEASURED and the doc defect FIXED (4f36dc948e). Owner rulings requested, both surfaced rather than taken:\n(1) THE LABEL. not_attempted is 85.8% (default) / 88.2% (nonprod) of ddg_mixed rows across 0007's cohort + 2. walk_verdict already discloses this on every JSON evidence row and in the text view (option d was already shipped), and the scope doc no longer says 'the walk ran'. Keep (a), or remap to (b)/(c)? INV-zidur refused (c).\n(2) A REMOVAL RULE. sink_before_source adjudicates 22 FP / 0 TP on the pretix nonprod arm (seeded sample, 0022's classifier, control reproduces 119/119). Refuting on it would raise that arm's precision from 27.5% to 35.0% with no sampled TP lost, but ADR-0052 makes refutation confirm-only, and a loop-carried value is the soundness exception. Full numbers are in my previous entry and on WI-mojaz."  # b4ff
