  message: "OWNER RULING (2026-09-22, in chat): KEEP the label (option a). A never-attempted walk keeps publishing as ddg_mixed.\nClosed wont_do, not done: the condition in the title still holds, by decision.\nWhy it is acceptable: walk_verdict is published on every JSON evidence row and in the text view, so not_attempted is disclosed (option d was already shipped). docs/VERIFY-CLAIMS-SCOPE.md no longer says \"the walk ran\" (4f36dc948e). Measured share: not_attempted = 85.8% (default) / 88.2% (nonprod) of ddg_mixed rows.\nQuestion (2), the sink_before_source removal rule, was ruled separately (\"not yet\") and is recorded on WI-mojaz."  # a585
